n attesa di una figlioletta. I due giovani vedranno però presto il loro rapporto sfiorire e il malessere esistenziale di lei riemergere prepotente e ingombrante."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Summer with Monika","overview":"One summer day, two teens begin a reckless affair and abandon their families to be with one another.","tagline":"A Picture for Wide Screens and Broad Minds."},{"language":"sv-SV","overview":"Efter att ha flytt storstadens bekymmer upplever Monika och Harry en passionerad sommar i skärgården. Befriade från omvärldens krav och omgivna av sol och hav upptäcker de erotikens berusande kraft, men Monika blir med barn. De gifter sig innan barnet föds och Harry går in för äktenskapet med liv och lust medan Monika snart blir uttråkad av att gå hemma. Deras skimrande sommardagar i havsbandet känns allt mer avlägsna."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/muRLpD3rhact16E4U0X5qLRsG5o.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kF5UhtIbadVqR0sfhzBBmwq8ToG.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":47735,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"sv-SV","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/muRLpD3rhact16E4U0X5qLRsG5o.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/muRLpD3rhact16E4U0X5qLRsG5o.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/muRLpD3rhact16E4U0X5qLRsG5o.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/muRLpD3rhact16E4U0X5qLRsG5o.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/82hLsn67V9TjgrLOZCFL7247pJd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/82hLsn67V9TjgrLOZCFL7247pJd.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://